description:
Extract the ZIP into a WARNO mod folder beside GameData and CommonData. Open YMB/YMB.exe, select or create a project, then build and sync. Run GenerateMod.bat and enable the mod in WARNO.

See the [documentation](https://github.com/Yokaiste/YMB/blob/master/docs/README.md) for setup and customization. Read the included LICENSE, NOTICE, and third-party licenses before sharing. Ask the [YSM Community](https://discord.gg/33Sqn6dTjf) for help.

